---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const sections = [
  {
    title: 'Startup / Projects',
    blurb:
      'Learnings from projects I’ve worked on in the past, and updates about stuff I’m currently exploring.',
    groups: [
      {
        pages: [
          { label: 'Hamster', href: '/hamster' },
          { label: 'Pet Projects', href: '/pet-projects' }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Reviews',
    blurb: 'Reviews of my favourite music, shows, and books. (Propaganda)',
    groups: [
      { name: 'Films / TV', pages: [] },
      {
        name: 'Music',
        pages: [
          { label: 'Hamilton', href: '/hamilton' },
          { label: 'The Strokes', href: '/strokes' }
        ]
      },
      {
        name: 'Books',
        pages: [{ label: 'War Of The Rats', href: '/war-of-ze-ratz' }]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Wandering',
    blurb:
      'A place to document my journey navigating through the roads of cities and rabbit holes of the internet. Both of them typically at ungodly hours.',
    groups: [
      {
        pages: [
          { label: 'Puzzles', href: '/puzzles' },
          { label: 'Familiar Neighbourhoods', href: '/multiple-homes' }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
---

<Base
  title="Het's Website"
  cover="/covers/journey.jpg"
  coverPosition="center 73.57%"
  coverCaption="still from one of the most beautiful games i have ever played (journey)"
>
  <h1>Het’s Website</h1>

  <p>
    Hi, I am Het. Welcome to my excuse for owning a domain. I like math, tech,
    history, pop culture, and yapping. Hit me up if you want to talk about any
    of the four (or an unrelated 5th thing), big fan of listening to people
    yap.
  </p>

  <p>
    I graduated with an EE degree from IIT Delhi in 2023. Currently, I am
    <s>unemployed</s> trying to build something me and my friends want. Before
    this, I was an AI research intern at the Vector Institute where I worked on
    improving sampling efficiency in model based RL. Hit me up if you want to
    talk about AI or startups.
  </p>

  <p>
    In my free time (which is getting increasingly hard to define these days),
    I like exploring — from trivia rabbit holes on the internet to food joints
    in cities. I’ve had the privilege of living in Ahmedabad, Delhi, (and now)
    Bangalore. Hit me up if you want to share food recommendations for any of
    these (or parts of Bombay).
  </p>

  <p><strong>tldr; Hit me up!</strong></p>

  <div class="contact-row">
    <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=916351492258">WhatsApp</a>
    <a href="mailto:2522het.patel@gmail.com">Email</a>
    <a href="http://twitter.com/hetnothate">Twitter</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/het-patel-81526a18b/">LinkedIn</a>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <p>
    This website is an attempt at getting myself to write and put myself out
    there more often. Most of what (I hope to) share will broadly fall into one
    of three categories.
  </p>

  {
    sections.map((s) => (
      <details class="section">
        <summary>
          <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▸</span>
          <h2>{s.title}</h2>
        </summary>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p class="muted">{s.blurb}</p>
          {s.groups.map((g) => (
            <>
              {g.name && <h3>{g.name}</h3>}
              {g.pages.length > 0 ? (
                <ul class="page-list">
                  {g.pages.map((p) => (
                    <li>
                      <a href={p.href}>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
                          <path d="M16,1H4v28h22V11L16,1z M16,3.828L23.172,11H16V3.828z M24,27H6V3h8v10h10V27z M8,17h14v-2H8V17z M8,21h14v-2H8V21z M8,25h14v-2H8V25z" />
                        </svg>
                        <span class="label">{p.label}</span>
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              ) : (
                <p class="muted">Nothing here yet.</p>
              )}
            </>
          ))}
        </div>
      </details>
    ))
  }

  <hr />

  <p class="muted">
    Right now, this is like a fresh notebook with just my name on the first
    page. Hopefully I’ll have more ‘pages’ by the time of your next visit :”)
  </p>
</Base>
